# What goes into the image is a list, not an exclusion: everything is left out except what the program needs.
# In particular no .ctb file (it carries the manufacturer's copyright notice), no data folder, no tests, samples, experiments or documents.
*

!requirements.txt
!LICENSE
!gerberslap
!gerberslap/**

# ... and of what is let in, what is not the program (the documents that sit next to a driver stay in the repository)
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.ctb
**/docs
